{"spec":"<div id=\"post\">\n    <div class=\"tab\">\n        \n        <h1 class=\"setting\">設定狙い：設定判別</h1>\n      \n        <p class=\"js-menu\" style=\"display: none;\">まずはココを見ろ！</p>\n        <div class=\"contents\">\n            <div class=\"left\">\n                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://media.slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/24005602/noimage1.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\">\n            </div>\n            <button class=\"close\">ー閉じる</button>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"js-menu\">設定判別項目</p>\n        <div class=\"contents\">\n            <div>\n                <table border=\"1\">\n                    <caption>通常時</caption>\n                    <tbody>\n                        <tr>\n                            <th style=\"width: 73%;\">項目</th>\n                            <th>重要度</th>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/下向きの矢印のアイコン素材.png\" class=\"icon-small\" alt=\"arrow\" loading=\"lazy\">天井ゲーム数の振り分け</td>\n                            <td>★☆☆☆☆</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/下向きの矢印のアイコン素材.png\" class=\"icon-small\" alt=\"arrow\" loading=\"lazy\">ボーナス確率</td>\n                            <td>★★☆☆☆</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n\n                <table border=\"1\">\n                    <caption>AT中</caption>\n                    <tbody>\n                        <tr>\n                            <th style=\"width: 73%;\">項目</th>\n                            <th>重要度</th>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/下向きの矢印のアイコン素材.png\" class=\"icon-small\" alt=\"arrow\" loading=\"lazy\">トップパネル</td>\n                            <td>★★★☆☆</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/下向きの矢印のアイコン素材.png\" class=\"icon-small\" alt=\"arrow\" loading=\"lazy\">共通ベル出現率</td>\n                            <td>★★★☆☆</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/下向きの矢印のアイコン素材.png\" class=\"icon-small\" alt=\"arrow\" loading=\"lazy\">スーハナモード移行率</td>\n                            <td>★☆☆☆☆</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n            </div>\n    \n            <button class=\"close\">ー閉じる</button>\n        </div>\n\n        <p class=\"js-menu\" style=\"display: none;\">ざっくり設定判別</p>\n        <div class=\"contents\">\n            <div class=\"left\">\n                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://media.slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/24005602/noimage1.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\">\n            </div>\n\n            <button class=\"close\">ー閉じる</button>\n        </div>\n\n        <p class=\"js-menu\">ツモった際のやめ時</p>\n        <div class=\"contents\">\n            <div class=\"left\">\n                <h3>大まかな目安</h3>\n                <h4>やめ推奨時間</h4>\n                <p>閉店1時間～1時間半前</p>\n\n                <h4>閉店欠損度</h4>\n                <p>★★☆☆☆</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"left\">\n                <h3>解説</h3>\n                <p>初当たり確率は比較的軽めだが、スーハナモードの存在があるため少し早めの見切りが必要。</p>\n                <p>スーハナモードのための32ゲームをフォロー後やめ。</p>\n            </div>\n    \n            <button class=\"close\">ー閉じる</button>\n        </div>\n\n        <p class=\"js-menu\">スペック</p>\n        <div class=\"contents\">\n            <div class=\"left\">\n                <h3>ボーナス(AT)確率</h3>\n                <table border=\"1\">\n                    <tbody>\n                        <tr>\n                            <th>設定</th>\n                            <th>初当り</th>\n                            <th>BIG</th>\n                            <th>REG</th>\n                            <th>&nbsp;合算</th>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定1</td>\n                            <td>1/231</td>\n                            <td>1/171</td>\n                            <td>1/345</td>\n                            <td>1/114</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定2</td>\n                            <td>1/224</td>\n                            <td>1/164</td>\n                            <td>1/331</td>\n                            <td>1/109</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定3</td>\n                            <td>1/216</td>\n                            <td>1/155</td>\n                            <td>1/315</td>\n                            <td>1/104</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定5</td>\n                            <td>1/206</td>\n                            <td>1/146</td>\n                            <td>1/297</td>\n                            <td>1/98</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定6</td>\n                            <td>1/197</td>\n                            <td>1/137</td>\n                            <td>1/279</td>\n                            <td>1/92</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"left\">\n                <h3>出玉率</h3>\n                <table border=\"1\">\n                    <tbody>\n                        <tr>\n                            <th>設定</th>\n                            <th>出玉率</th>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定1</td>\n                            <td>97.5%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定2</td>\n                            <td>99.5%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定3</td>\n                            <td>101.8%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定5</td>\n                            <td>104.5%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定6</td>\n                            <td>107.1%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n                <div class=\"caution\">\n                    <p> 注意</p>\n                    <p>設定Lは下パネルが常時点滅します。</p>\n                    <p>ただし、設定変更後コイン投入をしていない状態だと下パネルは常灯しているので注意。</p>\n                </div>\n\n            </div>\n\n            <button class=\"close\">ー閉じる</button>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"js-menu\">基本情報</p>\n<div class=\"contents\">\n    <div class=\"left\">\n        <h3>天井・打ち方・詳細情報</h3>\n        <table border=\"1\">\n            <tbody>\n                <tr>\n                    <th style=\"width: 50%;\">項目</th>\n                    <th>記載</th>\n                </tr><tr>\n                    <td><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/下向きの矢印のアイコン素材.png\" class=\"icon-small\" alt=\"arrow\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                        天井情報\n                    </td>\n                    <td>ボーナス間天井</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                    <td><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/下向きの矢印のアイコン素材.png\" class=\"icon-small\" alt=\"arrow\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                        打ち方\n                    </td>\n                    <td>通常時の打ち方<br>ボーナス中の打ち方</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                    <td><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/下向きの矢印のアイコン素材.png\" class=\"icon-small\" alt=\"arrow\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                        ハイエナ詳細情報\n                    </td>\n                    <td>その他のハイエナ情報</td>\n                </tr>\n            </tbody>\n        </table>\n    </div>\n\n    <button class=\"close\">ー閉じる</button>\n</div>\n\n        <p class=\"js-menu\">数値詳細</p>\n        <div class=\"contents\">\n            <div class=\"left\">\n                <h3 id=\"destination1\">天井ゲーム数の振り分け</h3>\n                <table border=\"1\">\n                    <tbody>\n                        <tr>\n                            <th>設定</th>\n                            <th style=\"width: 33%;\">777G</th>\n                            <th style=\"width: 33%;\">999G</th>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定1</td>\n                            <td>95.3%</td>\n                            <td>4.7%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定2</td>\n                            <td>94.5%</td>\n                            <td>5.5%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定3</td>\n                            <td>93.7%</td>\n                            <td>6.3%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定5</td>\n                            <td>92.9%</td>\n                            <td>7.1%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定6</td>\n                            <td>92.2%</td>\n                            <td>7.8%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n                <p>999G天井の選択率は高設定ほど優遇。</p>\n                <p>999Gが選択された場合は初当り後約50%でスーハナモードに突入します(777G天井時は約8%)。天井手前で当たってもこの恩恵は有効。</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"left\">\n                <h3 id=\"destination2\">ボーナス確率</h3>\n                <table border=\"1\">\n                    <tbody>\n                        <tr>\n                            <th>設定</th>\n                            <th style=\"width: 33%;\">初当り</th>\n                            <th style=\"width: 33%;\">自力初当り<br> (天井を除く)</th>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定1</td>\n                            <td>1/231</td>\n                            <td>1/246.8</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定2</td>\n                            <td>1/224</td>\n                            <td>1/237.7</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定3</td>\n                            <td>1/216</td>\n                            <td>1/227.2</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定5</td>\n                            <td>1/206</td>\n                            <td>1/215.0</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定6</td>\n                            <td>1/197</td>\n                            <td>1/204.1</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n                <p>初当りボーナスの当選率は高設定ほど優遇。右の値は天井恩恵によるボーナスを除いた通常時のボーナス当選率。</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"left\">\n                <h3 id=\"destination3\">トップパネル</h3>\n                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/superhanahana2__11.png\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                <table border=\"1\">\n                    <tbody>\n                        <tr>\n                            <th style=\"width: 50%;\">パネル</th>\n                            <th>期待度</th>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>変化ナシ</td>\n                            <td>デフォルト</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>青</td>\n                            <td>低</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>黄</td>\n                            <td>↓</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>緑</td>\n                            <td>↓</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>赤</td>\n                            <td>↓</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>虹</td>\n                            <td>高</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n                <p>BB・RB後、トップパネルの光る色で設定を示唆。</p>\n                <p>RB後に変化した場合は特定設定以上が確定!?</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"left\">\n                <h3 id=\"destination4\">共通ベル確率</h3>\n                <table border=\"1\">\n                    <tbody>\n                        <tr>\n                            <th style=\"width: 50%;\">設定</th>\n                            <th>確率</th>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定1</td>\n                            <td>1/27.0</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定2</td>\n                            <td>1/25.7</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定3</td>\n                            <td>1/24.4</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定5</td>\n                            <td>1/23.3</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定6</td>\n                            <td>1/22.4</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n                <p>共通ベル確率に大きな設定差が設けられており、高設定ほど出現率が高くなります。ただし、通常時は共通ベルを判別できないため、ボーナス中のナビなしベルをカウントする必要あり。</p>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"left\">\n                <h3 id=\"destination5\">スーハナモード移行率</h3>\n                <p>高設定ほどスーハナモード移行率が優遇!?</p>\n            </div>\n            <button class=\"close\">ー閉じる</button>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>","shukei":""}